-- ============================================================
-- EPMS demo data for Epic 4 (Administration, Finance & Royalty)
-- ============================================================
-- Gives a fresh database realistic data so every Epic 4 screen can be
-- demonstrated before Epics 1-3 are integrated: login accounts for each
-- role, 6 authors, 10 published books in 4 categories / 5 genres,
-- about 300 sales over the last 12 months (retail and bookstore, with some
-- cancelled and returned), and 6 active royalty agreements.
--
-- ORDER MATTERS:
--   1. mysql -u root -p < docs/epms-schema.sql     (base schema)
--   2. start the app once (Flyway applies the Epic 4 changes, V400)
--   3. mysql -u root -p epms < docs/demo-data.sql
--
-- Only for a fresh/demo database: rows use fixed ids 9001+ and demo emails.
-- Every account's password is:  Password@123
-- ============================================================

